  entries:
  - Why is Vulkan being so nice? He never usually takes an interest in my projects
    unless they're related to his own work... maybe he sees something in me after
    all?
  - 
  - I hope Vulkan is proud of me when he sees this thing fly... maybe then he'll
    finally consider me a real inventor
